WEBVTT

00:00:59.393 --> 00:01:00.895
This is a turquoise lake.

00:01:01.765 --> 00:01:03.000
A meditator.

00:01:03.873 --> 00:01:08.976
This is the hottest day of the year
somewhere in Eastern Tibet, on August 1.

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:13.976
And the night before, we camped,
and my Tibetan friends said,

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:15.581
"We are going to sleep outside."

00:01:16.261 --> 00:01:18.848
And I said, "Why? We have
enough space in the tent."

00:01:18.872 --> 00:01:20.696
They said, "Yes, but it's summertime."

00:01:20.720 --> 00:01:22.389
(Laughter)

00:01:25.295 --> 00:01:27.976
So now, we are going
to speak of happiness.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:30.795
As a Frenchman, I must say